       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GNUWORDS2.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       REPOSITORY.
           FUNCTION ALL INTRINSIC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TEXT              PIC X(20) VALUE "red green red".
       01  WS-WHEN              PIC X(30).
       01  WS-BITS              PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 12.
       01  WS-STATUS            PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE SUBSTITUTE(WS-TEXT "red" "blue") TO WS-TEXT
           MOVE SUBSTITUTE-CASE(WS-TEXT "BLUE" "red") TO WS-TEXT
           MOVE MODULE-DATE TO WS-WHEN
           MOVE MODULE-TIME TO WS-WHEN
           MOVE MODULE-PATH TO WS-WHEN
           MOVE MODULE-FORMATTED-DATE TO WS-WHEN
           COMPUTE WS-BITS = WS-BITS B-SHIFT-L 2
           COMPUTE WS-BITS = WS-BITS B-SHIFT-R 1
           MOVE COB-CRT-STATUS TO WS-STATUS
           DISPLAY WS-TEXT UPON STDOUT
           DISPLAY WS-WHEN UPON STDERR
           CALL "CBL_OC_NANOSLEEP" USING 1 RETURNING NOTHING
           STOP RUN.
